{"kind":"stack","id":"shadows-stack","title":"Shadows: how they are formed","theme":{"background":"#fdf6e3","foreground":"#1d3557","font":"Georgia, serif"}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c1","kind":"flash","elements":[{"type":"image","picto":"sun"},{"type":"text","id":"c1-t","content":"Light source"},{"type":"text","id":"c1-e","content":"Something that gives out its own light, such as the sun, a torch or a lamp."}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c1-btn-card","kind":"flash","elements":[{"type":"button","id":"c1-next","label":"Next Card","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c2"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c2","kind":"flash","elements":[{"type":"image","picto":"shield"},{"type":"text","id":"c2-t","content":"Opaque object"},{"type":"text","id":"c2-e","content":"An object that light cannot pass through, so it blocks the light and makes a shadow behind it."}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c2-btn-card","kind":"flash","elements":[{"type":"button","id":"c2-next","label":"Next Card","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c3"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c3","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c3-q","content":"Which of these is a light source?"},{"type":"button","id":"c3-a","label":"A torch","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c3-b","label":"A wooden chair","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c3-c","label":"A cardboard box","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c4","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c4-q","content":"What do we call an object that light cannot pass through?"},{"type":"button","id":"c4-a","label":"Transparent","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c5"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c4-b","label":"Opaque","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c5"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c4-c","label":"Translucent","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c5"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c5","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"image","picto":"shield"},{"type":"text","id":"c5-q","content":"A ball stops the torch light from reaching the wall. What is the dark area on the wall called?"},{"type":"button","id":"c5-a","label":"A reflection","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c6"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c5-b","label":"A shadow","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c6"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c5-c","label":"A rainbow","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c6"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c6","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c6-q","content":"Where is the shadow formed when light is blocked?"},{"type":"button","id":"c6-a","label":"In front of the opaque object","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c7"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c6-b","label":"Behind the opaque object","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c7"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c7","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c7-t","content":"You are walking in the park on a sunny day and your friend asks you to play. Which path do you take?"},{"type":"button","id":"c7-a","label":"Play in the shade of the big tree","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c8"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c7-b","label":"Chase your shadow across the grass","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c9"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c8","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c8-t","content":"The tree blocks the sunlight, so you find a cool dark patch under its leaves. The tree's shadow is the reason it is cool."},{"type":"button","id":"c8-next","label":"Continue","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c10"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c9","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c9-t","content":"You run after your shadow. Every time you move, your body blocks the sun and the shadow moves with you."},{"type":"button","id":"c9-next","label":"Continue","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c10"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c10","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c10-q","content":"Why does a shadow appear on the ground when you stand in sunlight?"},{"type":"button","id":"c10-a","label":"Your body blocks the light from the sun","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"end"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c10-b","label":"Your body makes its own light","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"end"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c10-c","label":"The grass pulls the light away","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"end"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"end","kind":"end","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"end-h","content":"Well done! You know how shadows are formed."},{"type":"text","id":"end-m","content":"Shadows form when an opaque object blocks light from a light source. Keep looking for shadows around you."}],"actions":[]}}
